      "writtenOn": "2023-03-09T19:42:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a need to auto-generate a mobly-specific test config when the current guidance (like on go/tf-mobly) is to just check in your own manual one?\n\nThe current implementation of autogenerating won\u0027t be able to handle some of the things go/tf-mobly tells you to do, like adding target preparers for each device, and adding the mobly yaml config file.",
      "parentUuid": "72acad99_2174395b",
      "revId": "b6a6dc9177532d5a2e89f2d27500c6c500647f6b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
